<title>SINGAPORE: SembCorp halves stake in aviation unit.</title>
<headline>SembCorp halves stake in aviation unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified maritime group SembCorp Ltd said on Friday its aviation unit was reducing its share capital by half.</p>
<p>The wholly-owned subsidiary, Sembawang Aviation Pte Ltd, had applied to Singapore's High Court to cut its share capital to Singapore $20 million from S$40 million, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The Court had given the order for the capital reduction to proceed.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
